            "block_content": "Your last task is to cite your sources fully, accurately, and appropriately. No one will accuse you of plagiarism for a misplaced comma, but some will conclude that if you cannot get these little matters right, you cannot be trusted on the big ones. There are many styles you can use for your citations, so find out which one your readers expect. Three are most common:",
